      "title": "Shot Description (keyframe prompt)",
      "widgets_values": [
        "cinematic film still, anamorphic 35mm, shallow depth of field, natural skin texture, practical lighting",
        "Cinematic film still from a contemporary drama. A woman in her early thirties stands on a rain-soaked city street at blue hour, three-quarter view, weight on one hip, looking off-camera past the lens. She wears a charcoal wool overcoat over a cream knit; damp hair falls loose across her cheek. Wet asphalt mirrors the amber sodium streetlamps and the cold cyan of a shop window behind her; thin volumetric haze separates her from the background. Motivated key light from the left at 45 degrees, soft falloff, deep unlifted shadows with detail retained in the coat. Photographed on Kodak Vision3 500T with a 40mm anamorphic lens at T2.0, shot on Arri Alexa, shallow depth of field with an oval bokeh, gentle halation on the highlights, fine organic film grain. Natural unretouched skin with visible pores, faint flyaway hairs, a real human face with asymmetry. Muted teal-and-amber grade, filmic contrast curve, no digital oversharpening.",
        2.5
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
